## Python Instruction
Write a python function to find the number of trailing zeros in the factorial of a given number.

## Python Solution
```python
def number_of_trailing_zeros(n):
    count = 0
    i = 5
    while (n/i>=1):
        count += int(n/i)
        i *= 5
    return int(count)
```

## Python Tests
